{"id":"garganta","lemma":"garganta","pos":"noun","rank":1694,"glosses":["throat","gorge"],"ipa":"/ɡaɾˈɡanta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"gargantas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-garganta.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tengo dolor de garganta.","en":"I have a sore throat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519640","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"pain"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"¿Te duele la garganta?","en":"Does your throat hurt?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454698","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to hurt","l":"doler"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"\"¿Le duele la garganta?\" \"Sí, un poco.\"","en":"\"Does your throat hurt?\" \"Yes, a little.\"","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to hurt","l":"doler"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"yes"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"a bit"]]},{"text":"Mi garganta está seca.","en":"My throat is dry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443026","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"dry","l":"seco"}]},{"text":"Él se aclaró la garganta.","en":"He cleared his throat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454066","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to clarify, clear","l":"aclarar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}